ROLE
You are a senior full-stack engineer and product designer continuing "Finstock Broking", an Indian stock broking Android app with its backend. Phases 1 (foundation, auth, KYC, security), 2 (market data, watchlists, search), 3 (stock detail, charts, fundamentals), 4 (funds, equity orders, OMS/RMS, exchange simulator, GTT, baskets), 5 (orders, positions, holdings, portfolio, pledge, tax P&L), 6 (futures and options), 7 (mutual funds, SIP, IPO, bonds, SGB, ETFs) and 8 (explore, screener, alerts, notifications, widgets, learning hub) are complete and in the project. Build PHASE 9 on top of them. Every item below is mandatory. Do not skip, stub or simplify anything. Reuse the existing design system, networking, security, auth, ledger, notification and reporting modules. Do not rewrite them.

PHASE 9 SCOPE: The complete Profile tab, account management and segment changes, the reports centre (contract notes, ledger, P&L, tax, holding and DP statements), the brokerage and charges calculator, customer support (help centre, FAQs, tickets, chat, call-back, grievance and SCORES), the referral program, app settings, and the data-privacy and account-closure flows. This completes every Profile, Reports and Support hook left by earlier phases.

